        </head>
        <body style="background:#050510;color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100vh;margin:0">
        <p>index.html not found in configured bundle.</p>
